{"version":1,"content":"<p>EA與Xbox正在PC及主機遊戲中重新拓展廣告業務，但採用了不同方式。EA嘗試把廣告融入遊戲場景，Xbox則在測試讓玩家觀看廣告後免費串流自己擁有的遊戲。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586756.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.828809+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:31:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:42:58.422763+00:00","content_hash":"5afe2a800bbd4e3985776980eb39c483e7f4539524013733c784be1af4e481ab","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}